<title>FINLAND: SAUNATEC PROPOSES FIM 1.90 1996 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SAUNATEC PROPOSES FIM 1.90 1996 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    1.90 vs 1.50</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   15.6 vs 12.6</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	22.7 vs 21.0</p>
<p> Depreciation					 5.7 vs 5.3</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 1.4 vs 3.1 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs nil</p>
<p> Net profit					  11.5 vs 10.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    54.3 vs 48.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish sauna equipment maker is Oy</p>
<p>Saunatec Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
